In this example, find the result. Which index pair does this scan return?
int[] a = {1, 3, 4, 6, 7, 9, 12};
int i = 0, j = a.length - 1;
while (i < j) { int s = a[i] + a[j]; if (s == 19) return new int[]{i, j}; if (s < 19) i++; else j--; }
return new int[]{-1, -1};

